{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>He split</b> — the meaning is rocks — many times in the great and awesome wilderness." "<b>And he gave drink</b> — defective, like וישקה אותם (and he gave them drink)." "<b>and abundant</b> — an epithet for תהום (the deep), and it comes by way of singular, like: בנות צעדה עלי שור (the daughters tread upon the wall). The reason is variation in words by way of eloquence."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:58.357780391Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}